{"4633850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Xtractorz", "steam_appid": 4633850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xtractoz is a Farming / Tower defense game. Your mission is simple, collect rocks, but watch out for the void monsters because they won't let you. You can play solo, or with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/9783941b9e5f834dd6489f8066ea7122.avif?t=1785661033\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/5ad87364e018f66a98c493ce41128b47.poster.avif?t=1785661033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/5ad87364e018f66a98c493ce41128b47.webm?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/5ad87364e018f66a98c493ce41128b47.mp4?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your expedition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip one tool and helmet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ship. As you upgrade your ship, you will unlock new turrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats to be more efficient at work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the turrets you want for your expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/f3b47fde0acc034a966e4835e6cd63c1.poster.avif?t=1785661033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/f3b47fde0acc034a966e4835e6cd63c1.webm?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/f3b47fde0acc034a966e4835e6cd63c1.mp4?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/b759011f3610e6026055376e2af56d26.avif?t=1785661033\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Areas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each map, certain areas are locked and require payment to access. Each area has rocks to collect and different activities to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/435c4094b3973b226dc740fde8eec373.poster.avif?t=1785661033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/435c4094b3973b226dc740fde8eec373.webm?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/435c4094b3973b226dc740fde8eec373.mp4?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Rocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach your expedition's rock quota to be able to leave. You can stay longer if you want to collect even more rocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/3788acd8adc978db2cebc849ab92ae96.poster.avif?t=1785661033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/3788acd8adc978db2cebc849ab92ae96.webm?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/3788acd8adc978db2cebc849ab92ae96.mp4?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect Your Ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget that you are not alone on your expedition, and you will have to protect your ship in order to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/4c069f71374352d4b9bbf4c4bf362f4f.poster.avif?t=1785661033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/4c069f71374352d4b9bbf4c4bf362f4f.webm?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/4c069f71374352d4b9bbf4c4bf362f4f.mp4?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xtractoz is a Farming / Tower defense game. Your mission is simple, collect rocks, but watch out for the void monsters because they won't let you. You can play solo, or with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/9783941b9e5f834dd6489f8066ea7122.avif?t=1785661033\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/5ad87364e018f66a98c493ce41128b47.poster.avif?t=1785661033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/5ad87364e018f66a98c493ce41128b47.webm?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/5ad87364e018f66a98c493ce41128b47.mp4?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your expedition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip one tool and helmet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ship. As you upgrade your ship, you will unlock new turrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats to be more efficient at work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the turrets you want for your expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/f3b47fde0acc034a966e4835e6cd63c1.poster.avif?t=1785661033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/f3b47fde0acc034a966e4835e6cd63c1.webm?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/f3b47fde0acc034a966e4835e6cd63c1.mp4?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/b759011f3610e6026055376e2af56d26.avif?t=1785661033\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Areas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On each map, certain areas are locked and require payment to access. Each area has rocks to collect and different activities to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/435c4094b3973b226dc740fde8eec373.poster.avif?t=1785661033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/435c4094b3973b226dc740fde8eec373.webm?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/435c4094b3973b226dc740fde8eec373.mp4?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Rocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach your expedition's rock quota to be able to leave. You can stay longer if you want to collect even more rocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/3788acd8adc978db2cebc849ab92ae96.poster.avif?t=1785661033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/3788acd8adc978db2cebc849ab92ae96.webm?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/3788acd8adc978db2cebc849ab92ae96.mp4?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect Your Ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget that you are not alone on your expedition, and you will have to protect your ship in order to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/4c069f71374352d4b9bbf4c4bf362f4f.poster.avif?t=1785661033\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/4c069f71374352d4b9bbf4c4bf362f4f.webm?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/extras/4c069f71374352d4b9bbf4c4bf362f4f.mp4?t=1785661033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Choose an expedition, mine rocks, and don't forget to protect your ship from the void monsters. They won't let you leave without a fight. This is an online co-op game with up to 4 players.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/c0202d2a8b2e40c2f031b692b6462e201f1cf991/header.jpg?t=1785661033", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/465818ece9ab7dbed5f3cde49824d0e4f62245a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785661033", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633850/465818ece9ab7dbed5f3cde49824d0e4f62245a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785661033", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-4690K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Voidry games"], "publishers": ["Voidry games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "descript